  "body": "syntax for defining blocks of javascript files\r\n\r\n```\r\n<scripts defer type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n    <resource src=\"assets/js/vendor.min.js\"></resource>\r\n    <resource src=\"assets/js/app.min.js\"></resource>\r\n    <resource src=\"assets/js/iconify.min.js\"></resource>\r\n    <resource src=\"assets/plugins/sweetalert2/sweetalert2.all.min.js\"></resource>\r\n    <resource src=\"assets/js/axios.min.js\"></resource>\r\n    <resource src=\"assets/js/installer.js\"></resource>\r\n</scripts>\r\n```\r\n\r\nimproved code semantics and definition of a group of files that must have the same download relevance and/or availability, allowing parallel downloading.",
